# ----------------------------------------
# typeseg PyPI package
# ----------------------------------------
# The broad `data/` rule above also matches packages/typeseg/typeseg/data/.
# Re-include that dir but keep only the source config (manifest.json); the
# weight blobs are generated from the committed checkpoints via
# `export_typeseg_weights.py` + `export_typeseg_onnx.py`.
!packages/typeseg/typeseg/data/
packages/typeseg/typeseg/data/*.npz
packages/typeseg/typeseg/data/*.onnx
packages/typeseg/dist/
packages/typeseg/build/
